When Should You Think of Binary Search?
                Many people answer:  Sorted array.
                
                That's only half the story. The real indicator is:
                
                        Can I eliminate half of the remaining search space after each decision?                
                If yes,
                
                Binary Search is probably applicable.

ALSO :
        Binary Search finds boundaries.

